@startuml StorageClassDiagram
' Name-only view of the main storage types; members and utility types are omitted.
' Associations show stored references. Dashed dependencies show use/creation.
hide members
hide circle

class "<<interface>>\nStorage" as Storage
class FileStorage
class LedgerCodec
class LedgerSnapshot
class LoadResult
class "LedgerCodec.DecodeResult" as DecodeResult

FileStorage ..|> Storage
FileStorage --> "1" LedgerCodec: codec
Storage ..> LoadResult: returns
Storage ..> LedgerSnapshot: saves
LedgerCodec ..> DecodeResult: creates
LedgerCodec ..> LedgerSnapshot: encodes / creates
LoadResult --> "1" LedgerSnapshot: snapshot
DecodeResult --> "1" LedgerSnapshot: snapshot

note bottom of LoadResult
    Includes warnings, saving permission
    and whether setup is required.
end note
note bottom of LedgerSnapshot
    Immutable financial state:
    opening balance, transactions,
    rates and custom categories.
end note
@enduml
